WEBVTT

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:37.176
Listen to me and see if you can imagine

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:42.536
the culture of whiteness
as a dehumanizing process

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.016
that melts away

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:49.976
all of our multiple
and interlocking identities,

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:55.816
such as race, class,
gender and sexualities,

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.040
so that ...

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:03.640
so that unity is maintained for power.